---
import type { CollectionEntry } from "astro:content";
import OriginalArticle from "../../components/article/OriginalArticle.astro";
import previewImg from "../../content/blog/image/ai-paper-latex/1767271685315.png";
interface Props { blog: CollectionEntry<"blog"> }
const { blog } = Astro.props;
const { title, description } = blog.data;
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>{title}</title>
  <meta name="description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:title" content={title} />
  <meta property="og:description" content={description} />
  <meta property="og:image" content={previewImg.src} />
  <meta property="og:type" content="article" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Crimson+Pro:wght@500;600;700&family=Source+Code+Pro:wght@500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+SC:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
</head>
<body>
  <div class="printworks">
    <nav class="press-nav">
      <a href="/blog/">LANGQI / COMPUTATIONAL PRESS</a>
      <span>PYTHON TO PAPER</span>
    </nav>
    <main>
      <section class="press-hero">
        <div class="press-copy">
          <h1>不要让 AI 写论文。<br /><strong>让它造一台论文机器。</strong></h1>
          <p>代码负责计算真实数据、绘制图表、组装 LaTeX。你只需要按下运行，机器会把可复现结果印成 PDF。</p>
          <button id="print-button" type="button">启动数字印刷机</button>
        </div>
        <div class="digital-press" id="digital-press" aria-label="代码驱动论文生成的数字印刷机">
          <div class="press-top">
            <span>AA.AAA.PY</span>
            <output id="press-status">WAITING FOR SOURCE</output>
          </div>
          <div class="press-body">
            <div class="source-feed">
              <span>PYTHON SOURCE</span>
              <pre><code>def energy(n):
  return n**2 * π**2 * ħ**2

plot(states)
write_latex(data, figures)</code></pre>
              <div class="feed-line" id="feed-line"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="press-core">
              <div class="roller roller-a"></div>
              <div class="roller roller-b"></div>
              <div class="plate"><span>NUMPY</span><span>MATPLOTLIB</span><span>LATEX</span></div>
              <div class="core-light"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="paper-output">
              <div class="paper" id="paper">
                <div class="paper-title">Quantum Infinite Potential Well</div>
                <div class="paper-authors">Computational Physics Report</div>
                <div class="paper-rule"></div>
                <div class="paper-cols">
                  <div><b>Abstract</b><i></i><i></i><i></i><b>Theory</b><span class="equation-line">Eₙ = n²π²ℏ² / 2mL²</span><i></i><i></i></div>
                  <div><b>Results</b><canvas id="wave-chart"></canvas><div class="paper-table"><span>n</span><span>Eₙ</span><span>1</span><span>0.376</span><span>2</span><span>1.504</span></div></div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="press-meter">
            <span>COMPUTE <b id="compute-meter">0%</b></span>
            <span>PLOT <b id="plot-meter">0%</b></span>
            <span>TYPESET <b id="typeset-meter">0%</b></span>
            <span>OUTPUT <b id="output-meter">0 pg</b></span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="press-thesis">
        <blockquote>AI 直接写文本会幻觉。AI 写出的程序，可以被运行、检查与重复。</blockquote>
        <p>目标从“交一篇文章”变成“构建一个能生成文章的系统”，数据、图表与公式便来自同一条计算链。</p>
      </section>

      <section class="assembly-line">
        <header><h2>一份脚本，三道工序。</h2><p>每一道都消费上一道的真实输出。</p></header>
        <div class="assembly-track">
          <article><span>COMPUTE</span><h3>数值计算</h3><p>NumPy 定义物理常数、能级函数和波函数。论文里的数字不再由模型猜测。</p><code>states = [wavefunction(x, n)]</code></article>
          <article><span>VISUALIZE</span><h3>科学绘图</h3><p>Matplotlib 从同一组数组生成 2D 曲线和 3D 表面图，并以 300 DPI 保存。</p><code>plt.savefig("fig.png", dpi=300)</code></article>
          <article><span>COMPOSE</span><h3>文档组装</h3><p>Python 把数据表行和图片路径注入 LaTeX 模板，输出完整的 paper.tex。</p><code>tex = template.format(data, figures)</code></article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="proof-section">
        <div>
          <h2>图文对应，因为它们来自同一次运行。</h2>
          <p>修改势阱宽度或量子数后，能级、波函数、表格与论文中的引用一起更新。可复现性不是附加项，而是流水线的自然结果。</p>
          <div class="proof-values"><span><b>1</b> Python 脚本</span><span><b>3</b> 自动工序</span><span><b>0</b> 手工粘贴</span></div>
        </div>
        <figure><img src={previewImg.src} alt="由 Python 与 LaTeX 自动生成的量子力学论文预览" /><figcaption>无限深势阱案例的自动生成结果</figcaption></figure>
      </section>

      <section class="prompt-blueprint">
        <h2>把需求写成机器规格。</h2>
        <div class="prompt-sheet">
          <p>请写一个 Python 脚本，用于模拟 <mark>我的课题</mark>。</p>
          <ol><li>使用 NumPy 计算核心公式。</li><li>使用 Matplotlib 绘制关键图表并保存。</li><li>生成完整 LaTeX，包含摘要、公式、图片与数据表格。</li><li>将全部输出写入同一个文件夹。</li></ol>
          <code>python aaaaa.py</code>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="compile-lane">
        <div><span>A</span><h3>Overleaf</h3><p>打包输出目录为 ZIP，上传项目并点击 Recompile。</p></div>
        <div><span>B</span><h3>本地编译</h3><p>安装 TeX Live 或 MacTeX，使用 LaTeX Workshop 或 xelatex 编译。</p></div>
        <blockquote>Code is all you need.</blockquote>
      </section>
    </main>
    <footer class="press-footer"><a href="/blog/">返回文章列表</a><span>CALCULATE. PLOT. TYPESET. PRINT.</span></footer>
  </div>

  <style>
    .printworks{--ink:#171815;--paper:#f1eee5;--red:#ef3f2f;--blue:#3159db;--yellow:#f2cc3f;position:relative;z-index:10000;min-height:100dvh;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink);font-family:"Noto Sans SC",Arial,sans-serif}.printworks~*{display:none!important}.printworks *{box-sizing:border-box}.printworks a{color:inherit}.press-nav{height:62px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:0 clamp(18px,4vw,62px);border-bottom:1px solid #a9a69d;font:600 11px "Source Code Pro",monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.press-nav a{text-decoration:none}.press-nav span{color:#6d6a63}
    .press-hero{min-height:calc(100dvh - 62px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:.76fr 1.24fr;align-items:center;gap:clamp(28px,4vw,70px);padding:clamp(30px,4vh,50px) clamp(18px,4vw,62px);background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f1eee5 0 44%,#e7e3d8 44%)}.press-copy h1{font:600 clamp(42px,5.2vw,78px)/1.02 "Crimson Pro","Noto Sans SC",serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}.press-copy h1 strong{font-weight:600;color:var(--red)}.press-copy p{font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:#5d5b55;max-width:540px;margin:28px 0}.press-copy button{border:0;background:var(--ink);color:#fff;padding:15px 20px;font:600 12px "Source Code Pro",monospace;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:7px 7px 0 var(--red)}.press-copy button:active{transform:translate(2px,2px);box-shadow:5px 5px 0 var(--red)}
    .digital-press{border:2px solid var(--ink);background:#b8bbb5;box-shadow:15px 15px 0 #292b28;min-height:680px;display:grid;grid-template-rows:44px 1fr 76px}.press-top{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:0 15px;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink);font:700 10px "Source Code Pro",monospace}.press-top output{color:#17462b}.press-body{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr .55fr 1.25fr;min-height:0}.source-feed{position:relative;border-right:2px solid var(--ink);padding:22px 16px;overflow:hidden}.source-feed>span{font:700 9px "Source Code Pro",monospace;letter-spacing:.1em}.source-feed pre{white-space:pre-wrap;margin:40px 0 0;font:11px/1.8 "Source Code Pro",monospace}.feed-line{position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:-6px;height:5px;background:var(--red);opacity:0}.printing .feed-line{opacity:1;animation:feed-scan 1.4s linear infinite}.press-core{position:relative;border-right:2px solid var(--ink);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:14px;overflow:hidden;background:#8f9692}.roller{width:42px;height:210px;border-radius:25px;background:repeating-linear-gradient(0deg,#202522 0 8px,#66706b 8px 12px);border:2px solid var(--ink)}.printing .roller-a{animation:roller-up .7s linear infinite}.printing .roller-b{animation:roller-down .7s linear infinite}.plate{position:absolute;display:flex;gap:5px;transform:rotate(-90deg);font:700 8px "Source Code Pro",monospace}.plate span{background:var(--yellow);padding:5px}.core-light{position:absolute;top:20px;width:10px;height:10px;background:#606863}.printing .core-light{background:#62d06b;box-shadow:0 0 0 6px rgba(98,208,107,.18)}.paper-output{position:relative;overflow:hidden;padding:24px;background:#d8d6ce}.paper{background:#fffdf8;min-height:570px;padding:34px 28px;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(23,24,21,.18);transform:translateY(500px);transition:transform 2.4s cubic-bezier(.16,.84,.24,1)}.printing .paper{transform:translateY(0)}.paper-title{text-align:center;font:700 18px Georgia,serif}.paper-authors{text-align:center;font:10px Georgia,serif;margin-top:8px}.paper-rule{height:1px;background:#222;margin:20px 0}.paper-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px;font:8px/1.5 Georgia,serif}.paper-cols b{display:block;font-size:10px;margin:8px 0}.paper-cols i{display:block;height:3px;background:#777;margin:7px 0;opacity:.35}.equation-line{display:block;padding:12px 4px;text-align:center;font-style:italic}.paper-cols canvas{width:100%;height:100px;border:1px solid #aaa}.paper-table{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;border-top:1px solid #333;margin-top:12px}.paper-table span{padding:4px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa}.press-meter{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:2px solid var(--ink)}.press-meter>span{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:10px 13px;font:700 8px "Source Code Pro",monospace}.press-meter>span+span{border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}.press-meter b{font-size:16px;margin-top:5px}
    .press-thesis{background:var(--red);padding:120px clamp(20px,7vw,110px);display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.25fr .75fr;gap:8vw;align-items:end}.press-thesis blockquote{font:600 clamp(38px,5.6vw,80px)/1 "Crimson Pro","Noto Sans SC",serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}.press-thesis p{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;border-left:1px solid var(--ink);padding-left:28px}
    .assembly-line{padding:120px clamp(20px,7vw,110px)}.assembly-line header{max-width:850px;margin-bottom:65px}.assembly-line h2,.proof-section h2,.prompt-blueprint h2{font:600 clamp(40px,5.3vw,74px)/1 "Crimson Pro","Noto Sans SC",serif;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:0}.assembly-line header p{color:#66635d}.assembly-track{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--ink)}.assembly-track article{padding:42px 32px;min-height:370px;display:flex;flex-direction:column}.assembly-track article+article{border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}.assembly-track span{font:700 10px "Source Code Pro",monospace;color:var(--red)}.assembly-track h3{font:600 30px "Crimson Pro","Noto Sans SC",serif;margin:30px 0 16px}.assembly-track p{line-height:1.75;color:#5c5a55}.assembly-track code{margin-top:auto;font:10px "Source Code Pro",monospace;background:#dedbd2;padding:12px}
    .proof-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.8fr 1.2fr;gap:7vw;align-items:center;background:#20211e;color:#efede6;padding:120px clamp(20px,7vw,110px)}.proof-section p{color:#b7b6af;line-height:1.8}.proof-section figure{margin:0}.proof-section img{width:100%;display:block;filter:grayscale(.15);border:1px solid #686963}.proof-section figcaption{font:10px "Source Code Pro",monospace;color:#a4a59e;margin-top:10px}.proof-values{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-top:50px}.proof-values span{font-size:11px}.proof-values b{display:block;font:600 42px "Crimson Pro",serif;color:var(--yellow)}
    .prompt-blueprint{padding:120px clamp(20px,10vw,160px);background:#d6ddf4}.prompt-blueprint h2{text-align:center}.prompt-sheet{max-width:850px;margin:60px auto 0;background:#f8f6ef;border:1px solid var(--ink);padding:clamp(28px,5vw,68px);box-shadow:12px 12px 0 var(--blue);font:18px/1.8 "Source Code Pro","Noto Sans SC",monospace}.prompt-sheet mark{background:var(--yellow)}.prompt-sheet code{display:block;margin-top:30px;border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding-top:20px;font-weight:700}
    .compile-lane{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1.2fr;background:#f3cf45}.compile-lane>div,.compile-lane blockquote{padding:80px clamp(25px,5vw,70px);margin:0}.compile-lane>div+div,.compile-lane blockquote{border-left:1px solid var(--ink)}.compile-lane span{font:700 11px "Source Code Pro",monospace}.compile-lane h3{font:600 34px "Crimson Pro",serif;margin:20px 0}.compile-lane p{line-height:1.7}.compile-lane blockquote{display:flex;align-items:center;font:600 clamp(36px,4.5vw,66px)/1 "Crimson Pro",serif}.press-footer{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:27px clamp(18px,4vw,62px);font:700 10px "Source Code Pro",monospace}
    @keyframes feed-scan{to{transform:translateY(520px)}}@keyframes roller-up{to{background-position-y:-24px}}@keyframes roller-down{to{background-position-y:24px}}@media(max-width:980px){.press-hero,.press-thesis,.proof-section{grid-template-columns:1fr}.press-hero{background:#f1eee5}.digital-press{min-height:650px}.assembly-track{grid-template-columns:1fr}.assembly-track article+article{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}.compile-lane{grid-template-columns:1fr}.compile-lane>div+div,.compile-lane blockquote{border-left:0;border-top:1px solid var(--ink)}}@media(max-width:620px){.press-nav span{display:none}.press-hero{padding:42px 14px 70px}.press-body{grid-template-columns:.75fr .45fr 1fr}.source-feed pre{font-size:8px}.paper{padding:20px 13px}.paper-title{font-size:11px}.paper-cols{gap:8px}.press-meter b{font-size:11px}.proof-values{flex-wrap:wrap}.press-footer span{display:none}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.printing .feed-line,.printing .roller{animation:none}.paper{transition:none}}
  </style>
  <OriginalArticle blog={blog} />
  <script>
    const press = document.querySelector('#digital-press');
    const printButton = document.querySelector('#print-button');
    const status = document.querySelector('#press-status');
    const meters = {
      compute: document.querySelector('#compute-meter'),
      plot: document.querySelector('#plot-meter'),
      typeset: document.querySelector('#typeset-meter'),
      output: document.querySelector('#output-meter')
    };
    const reduced = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;
    const chart = document.querySelector('#wave-chart');
    const drawChart = (progress = 1) => {
      const ctx = chart.getContext('2d'); const rect = chart.getBoundingClientRect(); const ratio = Math.min(devicePixelRatio || 1,2);
      chart.width = rect.width * ratio; chart.height = rect.height * ratio; ctx.scale(ratio,ratio); ctx.clearRect(0,0,rect.width,rect.height);
      ctx.strokeStyle='#3159db';ctx.lineWidth=1.5;ctx.beginPath();
      for(let index=0;index<=80*progress;index+=1){const x=index/80*rect.width;const y=rect.height/2-Math.sin(index/80*Math.PI*4)*rect.height*.32*(1-index/100);index===0?ctx.moveTo(x,y):ctx.lineTo(x,y)}ctx.stroke();
    };
    drawChart(0);
    const wait = time => new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, reduced ? 60 : time));
    let printing = false;
    printButton?.addEventListener('click', async () => {
      if(printing) return; printing=true; press.classList.remove('printing'); void press.offsetWidth; press.classList.add('printing'); printButton.textContent='印刷中';
      status.textContent='CALCULATING STATES'; meters.compute.textContent='100%'; await wait(650);
      status.textContent='RENDERING FIGURES'; meters.plot.textContent='100%'; drawChart(1); await wait(650);
      status.textContent='ASSEMBLING LATEX'; meters.typeset.textContent='100%'; await wait(650);
      status.textContent='PDF READY'; meters.output.textContent='12 pg'; printButton.textContent='再次印刷'; printing=false;
    });
    new ResizeObserver(()=>drawChart(press.classList.contains('printing') ? 1 : 0)).observe(chart);
  </script>
</body>
</html>
